Z||000000||billfredmike24||08-27-2001||11:14 PM||||I need a new catalytic convertor to pass my emmissions test and was wondering where i can get a high performance cat.  <A HREF="http://WWW.MUFFLERTECH.COM" TARGET=_blank>WWW.MUFFLERTECH.COM</A>  has one for $50, anyone have one or dealt with these guys. I don't think i'll put one on just to pass and then remove it, it'll be there for good.  Any recommendations.  Thanks Mike||||reg||1
Z||000001||Formula88||08-28-2001||09:22 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierostore.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cwestco.com</A> <P>All 3 of these vendors sell converters for Fieros.  Check them out and see which one you like the best.  I'll probably go with the one from <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A>  (West Coast Fiero) when I completely redo my exhaust with one of their SpinTech mufflers.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||08-28-2001||10:18 AM||||Try also at the local performance parts stores.  There are universal cats in all sorts of pipe sizes.  May be a bit more $ but you don't need to wait for the mail order guys to do their thing.  Means you're out on the road again pronto.<P>Gary||||reg||1
